s per grid so the color rule is inferable from few examples.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7ed72f31/D10/0/code.py:87:  changes into the paired legend color. That makes the D10 rule recoverable from 2-4\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/58f5dbd5/D16/1/code.py:59:#   corner pair whose left-hand color matches the block.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/58f5dbd5/D16/1/code.py:68:# - The mapping is explicitly shown by local A->B pairs; the solver does not rely on color ids,\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/58f5dbd5/D16/1/code.py:128:    - In the top-left corner, a vertical list of 1x2 color pairs [A, B] gives the replacement color for block color A.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6e453dd6/D7/0/code.py:46:#     - In input/output pairs, the only new non-empty content on the right is the colored target pixels.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:3:# Change: 精灵颜色 == 框架内目标像素颜色（s.color == d.color），通过颜色一致性将外部精灵与框架内单色像素配对 → 互补色匹配\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:22:#     - 新逻辑：占位色 src 匹配其互补色 complement(src) 的精灵。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:23:#     - 为了让规则在少量样例中肉眼可见，互补关系固定为少量可见颜色对：\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:30:#     - 只使用 3 组固定互补色，避免把颜色映射做成不可从 2-4 组样例稳定归纳的大字典。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:31:#     - 每个样例强制包含一整组互补对的两端颜色，再额外加入其他组颜色，保证训练样例里能直接观察到颜色互换。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:32:#     - 最终重着色颜色从独立池 {0,8,9} 中选择并与背景错开，避免和互补色线索混在一起。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:37:#     - 若图例目标色与互补色池重叠，会让 solver 的外部同色组件集合更难区分；因此 generator 将目标色与互补池分离。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:43:#     - 由于至少有一整组互补对的两端同时出现在框内，解题者能从 output 的形状来源直接看出颜色互换，而非误以为只是换了另一套图案。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:46:#     - 至少包含一整组完整互补对，且 K=3 或 4，使单样例就有重复支撑。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/edb79dae/D1/4/code.py:47:#     - 每个占位色的框外精灵颜色固定为其互补色，图例 source 仍是占位色