 variable-width\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/6/code.py:258:    narrower = [i for i, width in enumerate(frame_widths) if int(width) < max_width]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f215267/6/code.py:262:        int(rng.choice(narrower)),\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:12:  sprites are forced into a very narrow outer ring).\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:37:- The sprite band is intentionally narrow, but not so narrow that generation becomes impossible. A fixed\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:41:  That gives enough variety for matching while avoiding impossible 3x3-like sprites in the narrow ring.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:51:  assumption, so sprite generation must use a narrower shape library and lower sprite counts.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:92:  2. The outside sprite region is only the narrow perimeter ring around that large frame.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:282:# Sprite scattering in the narrow edge ring\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/67e490f4/25/code.py:464:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Try to place one sprite in the narrow edge ring.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:7:#    - 保留原题对象：3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙、对角线射线、撞墙换色。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:8:#    - 新增 D6 编码：每个箭头后方的反向对角线上放同色 tail；tail 长度 = 该箭头真实前进总步数。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:20:#    - 原 solver 假设所有非箭头非背景像素都是墙；融合后 tail 不是墙，必须先从同色箭头后方剥离。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:27:#    - tail、箭头、墙、真实路径、以及“本可继续前进的一格”都预留占位，防止固定步数与出界终止退化成同一件事。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:32:#    - tail 放在箭头背后且不与箭头 4 连通；墙颜色与箭头颜色分离；不同箭对象之间用 `blocked` 留出缓冲。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:33:#    - 输出只出现箭头、tail、墙、少量显影前缀和反射点，不会被整条隐藏路径搅乱。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:36:#    - tail 只编码数量，不编码颜色语义；同色 tail 与同色箭头一一配对，数数即可。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:41:#    - 假设：tail 是箭头同色、连续、位于反向对角线。generator 始终这样构造，并强制箭头颜色唯一。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:42:#    - 假设：墙不会复用箭头颜色。generator 从剩余颜色中取墙色，避免 tail 计数误吸收墙。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:66:def _is_arrow_pts(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> bool:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:74:def _arrow_dir_start_missing(\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:99:def _arrow_points(start_r: int, start_c: int, dr: int, dc: int) -> tuple[list[tuple[int, int]], tuple[int, int]]:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:119:def _min_segment_lengths(n_bounces: int, rich_arrow: bool) -> list[int]:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:123:    if rich_arrow and parts == 3:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:128:def _sample_segment_lengths(total_steps: int, n_bounces: int, rich_arrow: bool) -> list[int] | None:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:130:    mins = _min_segment_lengths(int(n_bounces), bool(rich_arrow))\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:161:    Trace diagonal rays from L-arrows, stop after a tail-encoded step budget,\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:168:    arrows: list[dict[str, object]] = []\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:169:    arrow_cells: set[tuple[int, int]] = set()\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:173:            if not _is_arrow_pts(pts):\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:175:            info = _arrow_dir_start_missing(pts)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:179:            arrows.append(\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/