       own_cells = arrow[\\\"cells\\\"]  # type: ignore[assignment]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:245:        cur_col = int(arrow[\\\"color\\\"])\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:260:            if (nr, nc) in arrow_cells and (nr, nc) not in own_cells:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:288:def _make_arrow(start: Coord, dr: int, dc: int) -> list[Coord]:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:330:    arrow1_col, arrow2_col, wall1_col, wall2_col = [int(x) for x in palette[:4]]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:338:    arrow1 = _make_arrow(start1, 1, 1)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:339:    arrow2 = _make_arrow(start2, -1, 1)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:347:    input_cells = set(arrow1) | set(arrow2) | {wall1} | set(wall2)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:348:    if len(input_cells) != len(arrow1) + len(arrow2) + 1 + len(set(wall2)):\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:363:    for r, c in arrow1:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:364:        grid[r, c] = out[r, c] = int(arrow1_col)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:365:    for r, c in arrow2:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:366:        grid[r, c] = out[r, c] = int(arrow2_col)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:372:        out[r, c] = int(arrow1_col)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/11/code.py:378:        out[r, c] = int(arrow2_col)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:15:#   - 保留原题对象词汇：3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙像素、对角线射线、侧碰/正撞反射。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:16:#   - 融合后的关键区别不是“射线轨迹互相变成墙”，而是“箭头按距离顺序发射，并共享一套会被擦除的活墙集合”。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:18:#   - 后续箭头看到的是更新后的墙场，所以顺序依赖来自“先发射者把后发射者本来会碰到的墙擦掉了”。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:21:#   - 近中心箭头 A 先发射，走到 W 左侧相邻格，因侧碰 W 而反射；输出中 W 被擦成 0，A 后续线段继承 W 的颜色。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:22:#   - 远中心箭头 B 后发射，原本它会在 W 上方相邻格再次侧碰该墙；但现在 W 已不存在，所以 B 不再转向，直接沿原对角线继续。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:26:#   - 生成器固定为 2 个箭头，避免多箭头多墙叠加导致顺序线索被淹没。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:27:#   - 共享墙放在网格中心附近，保证“离中心更近的箭头先发射”有明确视觉参照。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:28:#   - 远箭头被构造成必须依赖同一墙像素，否则输出会退化成原题近似；因此每个样例都稳定体现两项改动。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:29:#   - 仍允许 18-20 的原尺寸范围和原箭头形状，不改变任务阅读方式。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:31:#   - 原 `for start_col, pts in arrows:` 默认箭头彼此独立，顺序无关；融合后必须按中心距离排序。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:32:#   - 原 `wall_cells` 是静态集合；融合后必须改为所有箭头共享的 `live_walls`，并在命中时删除像素。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:35:#   - 原代码把所有非箭头像素都当墙；本版本仍沿用，但生成器必须保证没有别的伪对象混入。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:38:#   - 箭头、墙、两条射线的计划轨迹在输入中不重叠；输出中两条射线也不相交，避免颜色覆盖歧义。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:41:#   - 人类能直接看到：一个靠中心的箭头先在某墙处折返并留下颜色继承；同一个墙在输出中消失；另一个更远的箭头穿过本来会被该墙影响的位置却没有转向。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:46:#   - solver 假设箭头按中心距离可稳定排序；生成器让近箭头与远箭头距离差很大，避免 tie。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:51:def _is_arrow_pts(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> bool:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:59:def _arrow_dir_and_start(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int]] | None:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:92:def _arrow_points_from_start(sr: int, sc: int, dr: int, dc: int) -> list[tuple[int, int]]:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:97:def _detect_arr